<title>GERMANY: Colonia H1 gp premium income up 5.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Colonia H1 gp premium income up 5.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOGNE, Germany 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30.</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group premium income		  5,600     up 5.8 pct</p>
